    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a solo developer, my goal was to create a game about a YouTuber who risks his life by exploring a haunted house to boost his channel's popularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character equipped with just a flashlight, camera, and nerves of steel, venture into its eerie, decaying halls of a house that belonged to old couple. The silence and unsettling sounds keep you on edge as you piece together the tragic and supernatural past of the house. What begins as routine content soon turns into a terrifying reality, blurring the line between myth and truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what happened to the house and to old couple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the house\u2019s dark history and escape to share your story, or will you become another lost soul in the <i>The Dead House</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WASD for movement</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;C&quot; for Camera</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CTRL for crouching</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to </i>George Thompson<i>\u00a0for his dev services.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The character voices used in the game were generated by artificial intelligence.</i></p>",
